[00:13.099]Birds are born with no shackles
{"飞鸟生来无枷锁"}
[00:18.694]Then what fetters my fate?
{"为何命运困住我"}
[00:24.964]Blown away, the white petals
{"飘散的白花瓣"}
[00:30.152]Leave me trapped in the cage.
{"将我囚在牢笼间"}
[00:36.349]The endless isolation
{"无尽的孤独"}
[00:39.525]Can't wear down my illusion
{"磨不灭幻梦"}
[00:42.456]Someday, I’ll make a dream unchained
{"终有一天我要挣脱梦境"}
[00:49.262]Let my heart bravely spread the wings
{"让心勇敢展翼"}
[00:53.286]Soaring past the night
{"穿越黑夜"}
[00:56.165]To trace the bright moonlight
{"追寻皎洁月光"}
[01:01.513]Let the clouds heal me of the stings
{"让云朵治愈伤痕"}
[01:05.343]Gently wipe the sorrow off my life
{"轻轻拭去生命哀伤"}
[01:09.507]I dream
{"我梦见"}
[01:13.418]
[01:18.501]What is meant by “miracle”,
{"所谓奇迹究竟为何"}
[01:24.683]A word outside my days?
{"是我无法触及的字么"}
[01:30.982]Once again, repeat warbles
{"重复啼鸣"}
[01:36.167]But how could I escape?
{"却难逃这牢笼"}
[01:42.834]No further hesitation
{"不再犹豫"}
[01:45.644]On those unanswered questions
{"面对无解疑问"}
[01:48.630]So now, I’ll make a dream unchained
{"此刻我要挣脱梦境"}
[02:00.198]Let my heart bravely spread the wings
{"让心勇敢展翼"}
[02:05.390]Soaring past the night
{"穿越黑夜"}
[02:08.028]To trace the bright moonlight
{"追寻皎洁月光"}
[02:13.323]Let the clouds heal me of the stings
{"让云朵治愈伤痕"}
[02:17.204]Gently wipe the sorrow off my life
{"轻轻拭去生命哀伤"}
[02:21.724]I dream
{"我梦想"}
[02:37.378]Let my heart bravely spread the wings
{"让我的心勇敢展翅翱翔"}
[02:41.110]Soaring past the night
{"飞越黑夜"}
[02:44.046]To trace the bright moonlight
{"追寻那皎洁月光"}
[02:49.284]Let the clouds heal me of the stings
{"让云朵抚平我的创伤"}
[02:53.316]Gently wipe the sorrow off my life
{"轻轻拭去生命的忧伤"}
[03:00.083]I dream
{"我梦想"}
[03:06.135]I dream
{"我梦想"}
